  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic inputs, not player behaviour or win rates",
    "No economy, roster, full map, story selector or engine integration",
    "Feasibility only at mission entry; does not rescue later bad choices",
    "No verification of fun, willingness to pay or long-run optimal teams"
  ],
  "checks": [
    "leader decision does not blame uninvolved teammate",
    "relationships remain directional",
    "replayed event is not applied twice",
    "unobserved event cannot cause mind-reading resentment",
    "later discovery applies event once",
    "100 apologies cannot farm trust or clear memory",
    "wrong restitution cannot erase a different injury",
    "wrong restitution is rejected even after acknowledgement",
    "hurt then repair cannot farm trust",
    "same cooperation cannot be farmed",
    "one restitution action cannot pay for multiple harms",
    "serious unresolved memory retains a floor",
    "ordinary memory fades without infinite accumulation",
    "stress alone does not blame a teammate",
    "hysteresis stops threshold chatter",
    "repeated harm/repair remains worse than benign relationship",
    "harm/repair cannot farm any starting trust level 0..100",
    "100 event streams x 100 days stay bounded",
    "same seed reproduces mission",
    "difficulty comparison holds weather and equipment budget constant"
  ],
